  "question": {
    "text": "A box contains&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi></math> red balls and <math><mn>10</mn></math> black balls. <math><mn>3</mn></math> balls are drawn one by one without replacement. If the probability of choosing <math><mn>3</mn></math> red balls is equal to the probability of choosing <math><mn>2</mn></math> red and <math><mn>1</mn></math> black ball, then the possible value of <math><mi>x</mi></math> can be",
